	<key>readme</key>
	<string># GitHub CLI Workflow for Alfred

A fast, lightweight Alfred workflow for GitHub powered by Python 3 and the GitHub CLI (`gh`).

## Prerequisites
- macOS with Python 3 (installed by default or Xcode command line tools)
- GitHub CLI installed and authenticated:
  `brew install gh &amp;&amp; gh auth login`

## Usage
- `gh &lt;repo&gt;` : Instant search over your personal, organization, and starred repositories
- `gh &lt;repo&gt; ` (with space) : Deep repository navigation (pulls, issues, actions, commits, releases, etc.)
- `gh my pulls` : Open your Pull Requests
- `gh my issues` : Open your Issues
- `gh my stars` : Browse your Starred Repositories
- `gh @&lt;user&gt;` : Filter repositories by user or organization
- `gh s &lt;query&gt;` : Global GitHub search
- `gh &gt; refresh` : Force refresh local SQLite cache
